cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Station-MAE: weather station modelling with transformers"
abstract: >-
  A Masked AutoEncoder over MeteoSwiss SwissMetNet station data (PeakWeather).
  Given a 12-hour window of observations from 155 Swiss weather stations, the
  model forecasts five variables at 13 lead times from 0 to 6 hours, with a
  configurable fraction of stations hidden from the encoder so that forecasting
  and spatial gap-filling are learned in one objective. A spatially blind LSTM
  and two temporal baselines are included as references.
type: software
